From: RNSBox <rnsbox@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: sophgo: use USB gadget mode on the Milk-V Duo S

The RNSBox portal exposes a CDC-NCM management interface on the
board's single USB-C port, so the DWC2 controller must run in
peripheral mode.
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/sophgo/sg2000-milkv-duo-s.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/sophgo/sg2000-milkv-duo-s.dts
@@ -296,6 +296,6 @@
 };
 
 &usb {
-	dr_mode = "host";
+	dr_mode = "peripheral";
 	status = "okay";
 };
-- 
2.43.0
